    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1659-a5">

                <pb facs="1058" n="942" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg942"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Bluefields</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-08-17">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 17, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>A report relative to the prisoner was to be sent by passenger to Managua who is
                    not now going. The prisoner has been in the paying ward of the hospital since
                    the eighth ultimo and is slowly recovering but yet very weak. He is receiving
                    good treatment.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Clare</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
